{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And they shall say to the elders of his city: This son of ours is wayward and rebellious.</b> At first his father and mother bring him to a court of three, and they bring two witnesses that he stole from his father's property and purchased meat and wine with what he stole and ate it, and the court (bet din) flogs him after warning. If he went back and stole and did the same, they bring him to a court of twenty-three, and the witnesses with them, and they complete his judgment and he is stoned."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:49:58.858265053Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}